+| `visit_id` | Client | Client-generated visit UUID |
+| `plot_id` | Client | Catalog plot UUID |
+| `base_revision_id` | Client | `revision_id` the edit started from, or `null` for initial creation |
+| `idempotency_key` | Client | Unique key per logical edit attempt |
